  "factor_name": "60-day Range Location Reversal",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "-shift1((2*close - rolling_min(close,60) - rolling_max(close,60)) / (rolling_max(close,60)-rolling_min(close,60))",
    "description": "Ranks assets positively when yesterday's close was near the bottom of its 60-day high-low range and negatively when near the top; bounded range location is used as a cross-asset reversal signal. The signal is lagged one completed trading day to avoid look-ahead."
